            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Printing Techniques and Inks",
            "content": "<p>The sustainability of compostable labels can be further enhanced by using environmentally friendly printing techniques and inks. Water-based and soy-based options are examples of eco-friendly options. Also, HP Indigo’s printing inks have a TUV Austria and DIN Certco certification for use on compostable labels and flexible packaging materials.</p>",
