    "image_with_text_bjQBVp": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_PCpcqW": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "NADCO Tapes & Labels’ Efforts Towards Sustainability",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_VQGHnr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Nadco Tapes & Labels, sustainability is our core value. As a LEED Silver certified building, we actively recycle and repurpose packaging materials. Collaborating with HP Indigo, we offer compostable inks for eco-friendly label options, and our cutting-edge HP-Indigo 6k digital press showcases our commitment to sustainable printing. Moreover, we prioritize partnering with like-minded vendors who share our vision of greener manufacturing processes. Our printing plate vendor’s shift from analog to digital plate making, supported by a solvent reclaim system, reflects our dedication to reducing environmental impact. Embracing a future of eco-conscious practices, we strive to lead the industry toward a more sustainable tomorrow.</p><h3>Contact Our Experts for Compostable Labels</h3><p>As consumers become more concerned about global sustainability, they are attracted to eco-conscious brands. Embracing compostable labels is an excellent move towards ensuring a more eco-friendly footprint. Since each of our customers has different branding requirements, custom printed tapes and labels are available to match your unique ideas and intended applications.</p><p>At NADCO Tapes & Labels, we are experts in customization and have the capacity to convert and print in-house. We have a wide array of equipment, such as our HP Indigo digital press, to help us complete your project under a single roof. <a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact us\">Contact us</a> to talk to one of our experts today or <a href=\"/pages/request-a-quote\" title=\"Request a Quote\">request a quote</a> for more information. Or if you’d like specs on our Compostable Labels, you can visit the “Specialty” tab in our <a href=\"/pages/downloadable-spec-sheets\" title=\"Downloadable Spec Sheets\">Product Spec Sheets</a> page.</p>",
            "subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
